   "quote": "Table 2 : Main results on VideoMemBench. Models are evaluated under the self-rollout protocol. TurnAcc: accuracy over all turns, scored individually. EpiDepAcc: accuracy on turns with at least one Episodic dependency. AnsDepAcc: accuracy on turns with at least one Answer dependency under chain crediting. Overall: the arithmetic mean of the three metrics.",
